{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"sChanId":["297"],"sTitle":"🎁 集结委托 回归丽都","sIntro":"亲爱的绳匠，2.5版本「集结委托：回归丽都」活动现已开启。","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e亲爱的绳匠，2.5版本「集结委托：回归丽都」活动现已开启。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e邀请好友回归游戏，最高可得740菲林！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e回归绳匠和流失绳匠绑定好友邀请码，可得60菲林！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e参与网页内抽奖活动，更有游戏手办、游戏机、周边、菲林等奖励你领取。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e点击前往\u0026gt;\u0026gt; \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://hoyo.link/JA9qyz3RQ\" data-type=\"a\" link-type=\"game_none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"\u003ehttps://hoyo.link/JA9qyz3RQ\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动奖励一览】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003ePlayStation®5 Pro\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e猫宫 又奈 1/7手办\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e六分街系列拼装积木（随机）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e毛绒挂件盲盒\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动时间】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2025年12月30日 2.5版本「微光引灯时」上线后至 2026年2月6日 05:59:59（UTC+8）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【玩法说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e1. 邀请好友回归新艾利都，完成集结委托的挑战内容，最高可获得740菲林的奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2. 参与网页内抽奖活动，更有机会获取PS 5、手办、周边及海量菲林！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e3. 活动网页「集结委托：回归丽都」将于2026/2/6 05:59:59（UTC+8）关闭，请绳匠及时参与活动。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e※更多内容及详细规则请前往活动页面查看。 \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161756/43d75537e71ccb78b39b9f35608acff4_8312522971647208844.jpg\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS-1920x1080.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161756/826e345d40353397ec2251eb897ee383_7821889977250306001.jpg\"}]}","dtStartTime":"2025-12-30 12:30:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","sCategoryName":"","sTagName":[],"dtCreateTime":"2025-12-29 15:14:40","iInfoId":161756,"around":{"nextContent":{"sChanId":["295"],"sTitle":"《绝区零》照角色展示 | 兔兔解忧室","sIntro":"「要继续营业吗？但凡事都讲究等价交换，哼哼~你说对吧？」","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「恭喜照大人！」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「不愧是黑枝的不败神话，又霸榜了！」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「照大人！关于『兔兔解忧室』…由于点击率长期处于异常高值，资产回收似乎有一些困难…是否可以…」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「要继续营业吗？但凡事都讲究等价交换，哼哼~你说对吧？」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e▼YouTube\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"ttr-video-frame\" data-type=\"youtube\" style=\"margin:10px auto;width:100%;padding-top:56.25%;position:relative;\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/35fRoOYhE6Y\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"display:block;position:absolute;width:100%;height:100%;top:0;left:0;\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"EN.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161782/71bda3bb636b22defd9c015bb69e9a81_735822302940594668.jpg\"}]}","dtStartTime":"2025-12-30 12:00:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2025-12-30 10:29:58","iInfoId":161782,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""},"prevContent":{"sChanId":["296"],"sTitle":"「空明寻剑录」活动说明","sIntro":"「空明寻剑录」活动说明","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动时间】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2025/12/31 10:00（服务器时间）~ 2026/02/05 03:59（服务器时间）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【参与条件】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e绳网等级≥20级，完成主线第一章·幕间后即可参与。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动开启后，绳匠可以前往澄辉坪的随便观，与叶瞬光一同前往「青溟秘境」，寻找克服青溟剑反噬的方法。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动开启后，绳匠可以和叶瞬光共同探索「青溟秘境」，获得各种额外能力；利用这些能力完成试炼，可以让叶瞬光在「青溟秘境」内通过[剑意同调]获得独有的能力增幅。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 完成活动期间的限时奖励任务，即可获得活动专属音擎[青漪灵鼎]及其专属进阶材料、[「仓鼠笼」访问器]、[菲林]和各类养成材料奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e※推荐完成主线第二季第六章「微光引灯时」后参与该活动，以获得最佳体验。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【丽都纪事】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动将于时限结束后收录至[丽都纪事]，绳匠可于[丽都纪事]中继续体验活动内容。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动结束后将无法领取限时奖励，请注意活动时限，及时领取。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161765/3c38df8958cb143ff66854f1c016ad64_4507164819408376282.jpg\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS-1920.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/161765/058b6a87c7bdbaf367ba245a2b400749_7039212709725329264.jpg\"}],\"news-self-path\":\"\"}","dtStartTime":"2025-12-30 18:15:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2025-12-29 17:01:06","iInfoId":161765,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""}},"sSign":""}}